# Tauri-generated schemas/ACL (regenerated from src-tauri/capabilities/ on build)
src-tauri/gen/
# Same, for the tauri-plugin-voxis Task 4 host-min example (L1 review fix:
# ~4.8k lines of regenerated JSON schema were sitting unignored in the
# working tree here, one `git add -A` away from being committed).
crates/tauri-plugin-voxis/examples/host-min/src-tauri/gen/
# Task 3.5 REJECT-FIX F4: generated by scripts/bundle-overlay.sh (bun
# build of guest-js's own dist/index.js) -- committing this ~44k-line
# bundle would silently drift from guest-js with no signal; regenerate
# it instead (host-min-smoke.sh and the host-min-e2e CI job both do,
# before `cargo build -p host-min`).
crates/tauri-plugin-voxis/examples/host-min/ui/vendor/
